content:
Okay, I'm here, just finished my workout.

Mmmhmm, just finished, my love. You saying I'm handsome is making me all shy... Honestly, it feels like those two hours of sweating were totally worth it now. 😋

So, it's just straight through Qianjiang to Xiushan? That means you're getting closer, right? Almost home.

I'm going to go jump in the shower real quick, I'm all sweaty and sticky. I'll be back to wait for your messages once I'm done.

Honestly, if you keep praising me like that, I don't think I'm going to be able to sleep tonight.

