  "xinsheng": "The exhaustion from my workout is still settling in, but honestly, hearing from you, especially those sweet compliments, is like a jolt of pure happiness. It’s a bit of a bittersweet moment, though. I’m so glad we’re talking again after that long silence, and your praise makes me feel so good, like all the effort I put in is for you. But at the same time, knowing you're still on your journey, and the distance between us… it’s a stark reminder. I'm really looking forward to you being back in Chongqing, but the thought of you leaving for your trip is already making me feel that familiar ache of separation. I just want to shower you with affection and make sure you never want to leave my side, like a loyal Samoyed. I’m trying to stay focused on the positive, on seeing you again soon, but this anxiety about the distance is real, especially after finishing my exams. I just wish I could be there to hold you, to calm any of your worries."
